--- !u!114 &771014137
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 771014099}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 60
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 'You approach the door, looking at it more closely in the bright light
    and you spot, very faint, the outline of a label on the smooth metal.{wi}

    It
    says {b}Door A147{/b}{w=1}


    This is an interesting development.


    "Open
    Door A147," you say.


    From the grille comes a smooth artificial voice. "Cannot
    comply, you do not have required clearance."


    There''s a pop and you hear
    a human throat being cleared.

    {wc}

    "Hello? What''s that going on down
    there?"


    You struggle for something to say.


    "Eh, what up?"


    Oh
    dear.{w=2}


    "What?"


    You decide to try again.{wc}

    "Em, hello.
    I''m just trying to figure out what''s going on."


    "Oh, well, that''ll all
    be covered in orientation tomorrow, just try to relax and remain calm until then."{wi}'
